"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com\"}],\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#organization\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#webpage\"}},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do charities in the UAE accept all types of toys?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Most organizations accept gently used toys, but guidelines vary. Generally, hard plastic toys, educational games, and clean stuffed animals are welcomed. Broken or dirty toys are usually rejected.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How can I arrange a toy pickup for donation in Dubai?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Charities like *Beit Al Khair Society* and *Dar Al Ber Society* often offer pickup services for large donations (furniture + toys). You typically need to call their hotline or book via their app.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where can I donate used toys in Abu Dhabi?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The best spots are the UAE Red Crescent and the Beit Al Khair Society. Both have multiple branches and donation boxes throughout the city.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the best way to dispose of broken electronic toys?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Do not donate broken electronics. They should be recycled. Look for \\\"E-Waste\\\" bins in major electronics retailers like Sharaf DG or Dubai Municipality recycling centers.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does Dubai Cares accept used toys?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Generally, no. Dubai Cares focuses on education and building schools. For physical toy donations, Toys With Wings or Thrift for Good are better options.\"}}]}]}0:{\"buildId\":\"0l0HEHUer7u9z1jFStNEN\",\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML